      "writtenOn": "2025-02-14T15:38:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`HasCodeItem()` is used in different contexts. The `ClassLinker::LoadClass()` does not deal with runtime and proxy methods, so it needs only the access flags check (it doesn\u0027t even have an `ArtMethod` at that point), so I pulled it out to a separate function. I didn\u0027t want to call it `HasCodeItem()` because there is no runtime or proxy method check. If you can suggest a better name than `NeedsCodeItem()`, I want to hear it.\n\n(AI suggested edit is rubbish as usual.)",
