      "writtenOn": "2025-02-14T15:38:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is essentially a question for Lokesh about how does CMC handle the `LinearAlloc` space. I didn\u0027t feel confident enough to pull it out of the Runnable state as I don\u0027t know if that could introduce any new races. The lack of annotation on `AllocArt{Field,Method}Array()` could be due to historical reasons and may not reflect actual requirements as those functions predate CMC.\n\n(AI suggested edit is rubbish as usual.)",
