      "writtenOn": "2025-02-16T20:14:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need this to be done in runnable state because otherwise it races with CompationPause. These allocations may require allocating new arenas, and the assumtion in CompactionPause is that it can\u0027t be happening simultaneously as the gc-thread holds mutator_lock exclusively.",
